uradas, sur sagara","slug":"shri-suradas-sur-sagara","biography":"","metadata":null,"imageUrl":null,"verses":[{"id":"local-384","title":"जब ते प्रीति श्याम से कीन्ही","category":"Shloka","sanskrit_text":"जब ते प्रीति श्याम से कीन्ही,ता दिन तैं मेरें इन नैननि, नैकुहुँ नींद न लीन्ही।","hindi_text":"जब से मैंने श्याम सुन्दर से प्रीति की है, उस दिन से अब तक एक क्षण को भी मेरे इन नैनों ने नींद नहीं ली।","english_text":null,"english_translation":"Ever since I have loved Shyam Sundar, my eyes have not slept even for a moment from that day till now.","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5c23c8597f2c6a00524cdff7/jab-te-preeti-shyam-se-keenhi-shri-soordas-soorsagar-","author":"श्री सूरदास, सूर सागर","status":"published","content_text":"जब ते प्रीति श्याम से कीन्ही,\nता दिन तैं मेरें इन नैननि, नैकुहुँ नींद न लीन्ही।\n- श्री सूरदास, सूर सागर\nजब से मैंने श्याम सुन्दर से प्रीति की है, उस दिन से अब तक एक क्षण को भी मेरे इन नैनों ने नींद नहीं ली।","tags":["Braj Rasik","Mass Import"],"image_urls":[],"video_urls":[],"media_links":[],"source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5c23c8597f2c6a00524cdff7/jab-te-preeti-shyam-se-keenhi-shri-soordas-soorsagar-","slug":"jab-te-priti-shyam-se-kinhi"},{"id":"local-603","title":"धनि यह वृन्दावन की रेनू","category":"Shloka","sanskrit_text":"धनि यह वृन्दावन की रेनू,सूरदास ह्वां की सरवरि नहि, कल्पवृक्ष सुर धैनु।।","hindi_text":"श्री वृन्दावन धाम की रज धन्य है। इस रज की तुलना के सामने तो समस्त इच्छाओं को पूरा करने वाली कामधेनु और कल्पवृक्ष भी नगण्य हैं।","english_text":null,"english_translation":"Blessed is the dust of Vrindavan. Shri Soor Das says, \"Kamdhenu and Kalpavriksh which fulfills all the desires of a soul, is nothing, in comparison to its dust.\"","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5c0f83da7e32750058872af5/dhani-yeh-vrindavan-ki-renu-shri-soordas-soorsagar","author":"श्री सूरदास, सूर सागर","status":"published","content_text":"धनि यह वृन्दावन की रेनू,\nसूरदास ह्वां की सरवरि नहि, कल्पवृक्ष सुर धैनु।।\n- श्री सूरदास, सूर सागर\nश्री वृन्दावन धाम की रज धन्य है। इस रज की तुलना के सामने तो समस्त इच्छाओं को पूरा करने वाली कामधेनु और कल्पवृक्ष भी नगण्य हैं।","tags":["Braj Rasik","Mass Import"],"image_urls":[],"video_urls":[],"media_links":[],"source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5c0f83da7e32750058872af5/dhani-yeh-vrindavan-ki-renu-shri-soordas-soorsagar","slug":"dhani-yah-vrindavan-ki-renu"}],"books":[],"rawItem":null}}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","saints","children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","saints","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[null,["$","div",null,{"lang":"hi","children":["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]}]],null],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/cbf73327883ccb7f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","1",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/fe995a1e4635138b.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","2",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/848f1edf91a8622f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en","className":"